# Developing a Learning Strategy Using Pattern Notes: A New Technology.

**Authors:** Jonassen, David H.

## Abstract
Describes types of learning and organizational strategies and suggests that pattern noting--a technique to organize information in a relational manner showing linkages between topics--is a powerful organizational strategy. An algorithmic procedure for semantically analyzing pattern notes and various pattern note applications are described. (Author/MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ307113

